    "帳目資料尚未開啟。你可以重試，或匯出診斷與已有的備份以便排查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account data has not been opened. Retry or export diagnostics and an existing backup for troubleshooting."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account data has not been opened. Retry or export diagnostics and an existing backup for troubleshooting."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帳簿データはまだ開かれていません。再試行するか、診断情報と既存のバックアップを出力して問題を調べてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账目数据尚未打开。你可以重试，或导出诊断与已有的备份以便排查。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帳目資料尚未開啟。你可以重試，或匯出診斷與已有的備份以便排查。"
          }
        }
