    },
    "這些餘額會記為「資產調整」交易，不計入收入/支出報表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These balances are recorded as asset adjustment transactions and are not counted in income/expense reports."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの残高は「資産調整」取引として記録され、収支レポートには含まれません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些余额会记为「资產调整」交易，不計入收入/支出报表。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些餘額會記為「資產調整」交易，不計入收入/支出報表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這是手動平賬：不會建立現金或銀行交易，也不會計入收入/支出，只會在代墊紀錄中留下審計紀錄。": {
      "comment": "A description of how a manual debt settlement is processed.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是手動平賬：不會建立現金或銀行交易，也不會計入收入/支出，只會在代墊紀錄中留下審計紀錄。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是手动平账：不会建立现金或银行交易，也不会计入收入/支出，只会在代垫记录中留下审计记录。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a manual settlement: it will not create a cash or bank transaction, and it will not count as income or expense. It only leaves an audit record in the advance history."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これは手動決済です。現金または銀行取引は作成されず、収入/支出にも計上されません。立替記録に監査用の記録だけを残します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這會以遠端備份覆蓋目前資料庫。建議先確認你已有本地備份。": {
      "comment": "A message displayed in a confirmation alert.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will overwrite the current database with the remote backup. Make sure you have a local backup first."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リモートバックアップで現在のデータベースを上書きします。先にローカルバックアップがあることを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会以远端备份覆蓋目前资料庫。建議先確认你已有本地备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
