            "value": "這會以遠端備份覆蓋目前資料庫。建議先確認你已有本地備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這會新增一筆「資產調整」交易來調整該幣種總額，不計入收入/支出報表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This adds an asset adjustment transaction to adjust the total for this currency. It is not counted in income/expense reports."
